{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"design/tokens.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T05:08:15.979928Z","id":"b3413ad35f8c835250f6140db0b4cc6ac8eb0af36c1cc0df226a0298d43db39f","body":{"detail":"Failure: dark theme, select text in any Flutter TextField (apps/clax_app/lib/ui/theme.dart:158-162 sets selectionColor: p.selectionBg, opaque) or on the home page (apps/clax_app/home/home.css:41, ::selection { background: var(--selection-bg); color: var(--fg) }). The text stays fg #ecebe7 on #f6d3c7: 1.17:1. Flutter cannot recolour selected text, so the dark selection needs its own value (or alpha); the shell avoids this with a fixed --selection-fg #1c1b19 (web/shell/src/theme.css:28,63) that design/tokens.json has no counterpart for. No contrast pair covers fg on selection-bg (design/tokens.json contrast list), so //design:tokens_sync stays green.","kind":"blocker","span":{"start":{"line":23},"end":{"line":23},"content_hash":"6dfbc49c65d2ad884956903ea5d8c0ffd15ff3cce9e2130ed56d4ca22b32db1e"},"suggested_fix":"Give selection-bg a dark value that fg reads on (or a selection-fg used by home.css, and a translucent selectionColor in Flutter), and add the pair to contrast.","summary":"Selected text is unreadable in dark mode: selection-bg is #f6d3c7 in both themes and nothing sets a dark-safe text colour over it","tags":["review","ui-phase-1","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"design/tokens.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T05:08:15.982256Z","id":"7dafe06ce9be9477c0e2e269f3c9cad5ff83e96261312731957033724c85ba85","body":{"detail":"Text uses: apps/clax_app/assets/kit/kit.css .k-faint, done titles, field hints, placeholders and chart labels. border-strong measures 3.57:1 on bg in light, 4.24 on bg and 3.93 on card in dark: below 4.5 for text. No contrast pair checks it as text.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":188},"end":{"line":188},"content_hash":"382ddeea76894a8501eaed9c01bc5014694b676a26a9d7096b9d1d5d2e10e3e5"},"suggested_fix":"Map --k-fg-3 to muted (or a new faint text token held to 4.5).","summary":"--k-fg-3 maps to border-strong, a 3.0 boundary colour, but the kit uses it for text","tags":["review","ui-phase-1","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"design/tokens.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:13:52.169227Z","id":"5dc0e33cf427843445d4b1b875f48b20c6a3081410bf8a7f166311a5f613b0df","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:49a0cccabd27","summary":"selection-fg (home.css ::selection) and selection-tint (theme.dart selectionColor, rgba(246,211,199,.28) in dark) with their contrast pairs. 'selected text reads on the selection in both themes' failed before (1.17) and passes: `bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_theme_test` PASSED; 'selected text is dark on the pink selection' passes: `bazelisk test //web:e2e_rest --test_arg=--grep=home-app` exit 0; `bazelisk test //scripts:sync_tokens //design:tokens_sync` PASSED.","supersedes":"b3413ad35f8c835250f6140db0b4cc6ac8eb0af36c1cc0df226a0298d43db39f","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"design/tokens.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:13:52.211576Z","id":"ae3d87505e949f7f4b7433761a026de19507604230406bfe76de4b8f740a47b0","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:49a0cccabd27","summary":"--k-fg-3 maps to muted. kit.spec.ts's 'text on the kit's fills and its faint text meet 4.5:1' passes in light and dark: `bazelisk test //web:e2e_rest --test_arg=--grep=kit.spec` exit 0.","supersedes":"7dafe06ce9be9477c0e2e269f3c9cad5ff83e96261312731957033724c85ba85","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
